  "code": "from cyhole.jupiter import Jupiter\nfrom cyhole.jupiter.client import GetSwapOrderParams, PostSwapExecuteBody\n\n# Standard Solana token mint addresses\nSOL_MINT = \"So11111111111111111111111111111111111111112\"\nUSDC_MINT = \"EPjFWaLb3odcccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc\"\n\n# Example user public key (replace with actual wallet address)\nUSER_PUBLIC_KEY = \"YourSolanaWalletAddressHere\"\n\n# Initialize Jupiter client (lite tier, no API key needed)\njupiter = Jupiter()\n\n# Step 1: Request a swap order (quote) to swap SOL for USDC\nswap_order_params = GetSwapOrderParams(\n    inputMint=SOL_MINT,\n    outputMint=USDC_MINT,\n    amount=1_000_000,  # 1 SOL in lamports (1 SOL = 1,000,000 lamports)\n    userPublicKey=USER_PUBLIC_KEY,\n    slippageBps=100,  # 1% slippage\n)\n\n# Get the swap order (quote)\nswap_order_response = jupiter.client.get_swap_order(swap_order_params)\nprint(\"Swap Order Response:\")\nprint(swap_order_response)\n\n# Step 2: Execute the swap\nswap_execute_body = PostSwapExecuteBody(\n    quoteResponse=swap_order_response,\n    userPublicKey=USER_PUBLIC_KEY,\n)\n\n# Execute the swap\nswap_execute_response = jupiter.client.post_swap_execute(swap_execute_body)\nprint(\"\\nSwap Execute Response:\")\nprint(swap_execute_response)",
  "result_text": "```python\nfrom cyhole.jupiter import Jupiter\nfrom cyhole.jupiter.client import GetSwapOrderParams, PostSwapExecuteBody\n\n# Standard Solana token mint addresses\nSOL_MINT = \"So11111111111111111111111111111111111111112\"\nUSDC_MINT = \"EPjFWaLb3odcccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc\"\n\n# Example user public key (replace with actual wallet address)\nUSER_PUBLIC_KEY = \"YourSolanaWalletAddressHere\"\n\n# Initialize Jupiter client (lite tier, no API key needed)\njupiter = Jupiter()\n\n# Step 1: Request a swap order (quote) to swap SOL for USDC\nswap_order_params = GetSwapOrderParams(\n    inputMint=SOL_MINT,\n    outputMint=USDC_MINT,\n    amount=1_000_000,  # 1 SOL in lamports (1 SOL = 1,000,000 lamports)\n    userPublicKey=USER_PUBLIC_KEY,\n    slippageBps=100,  # 1% slippage\n)\n\n# Get the swap order (quote)\nswap_order_response = jupiter.client.get_swap_order(swap_order_params)\nprint(\"Swap Order Response:\")\nprint(swap_order_response)\n\n# Step 2: Execute the swap\nswap_execute_body = PostSwapExecuteBody(\n    quoteResponse=swap_order_response,\n    userPublicKey=USER_PUBLIC_KEY,\n)\n\n# Execute the swap\nswap_execute_response = jupiter.client.post_swap_execute(swap_execute_body)\nprint(\"\\nSwap Execute Response:\")\nprint(swap_execute_response)\n```",
